        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jared Fogle\n- Works: \"Jared Has Aides\"\n- Organizations: South Park, Subway\n- Concepts: weight loss, AIDS misunderstanding, advertising campaigns\n\nFacts:\n- In the episode \"Jared Has Aides,\" Jared Fogle incurs the wrath of South Park after announcing that he lost weight because he has aides, which is misinterpreted as AIDS.\n- After significant weight loss attributed to eating Subway sandwiches, Jared Fogle served as a spokesperson for Subway's advertising campaigns from 2000 to 2015.",
